[00:26:26Z] DIRS:     mkdir <path>, rmdir <path>  (create / remove empty directories)
[00:26:26Z] MOUNT:    mount write|append|rm|mkdir <path> [text]  (the one namespace, by prefix)
[00:26:26Z]           rm -r <dir>  (recursively delete a directory tree; root refused)
[00:26:26Z] COPY:     cp [-f] <src> <dst>  (copy a file; cp FILE DIR/ lands as DIR/<leaf>)
