[00:26:26Z] MOVE:     mv [-f] <src...> <dst>  (move/rename a file or dir, O(1); mv SRC DIR/ lands as DIR/<leaf>)
[00:26:26Z] FLAGS:    default is no-clobber; -f = force overwrite (rm: quiet on missing), -n = no-clobber
